WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:08.742 size:53% position:73% line:53%
campus McDonald de MCGill.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.777 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Une vieille grange en pierres,

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:10.811 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui n'a rien d'un musée, abrite

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:11.845 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pourtant des pièces uniques

00:00:09.877 --> 00:00:12.880 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de l'aviation.

00:00:10.911 --> 00:00:13.914 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Comme cette réplique, grandeur

00:00:11.946 --> 00:00:14.915 size:53% position:73% line:53%
nature F F Fairchild FC-2

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:19.219 size:53% position:73% line:53%
construit à Montréal par

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:20.220 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la Canadian Vickers, à partir

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:21.255 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de 1928.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:22.256 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ERIC CAMPBELL, bénévole,

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.323 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Musée de l'aviation de Montréal

00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:24.324 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est le premier avion

00:00:22.356 --> 00:00:25.359 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au Canada, avec une

00:00:23.424 --> 00:00:26.393 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cabine chauffée.

00:00:24.425 --> 00:00:28.495 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ou ce Curtiss-Reid, biplace,

00:00:25.459 --> 00:00:29.496 size:53% position:73% line:53%
fabriqué à Cartierville, aussi à

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:30.531 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la fin des années 20.

00:00:28.596 --> 00:00:31.765 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est très intéressant

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:33.267 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le cockpit, il y a un "compa

00:00:30.631 --> 00:00:34.802 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dedans qui est d'origine,

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:36.303 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui vaut beaucoup d'argent

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:37.838 size:53% position:73% line:53%
maintenant.

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:39.340 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Une dizaine de bénévoles,

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:40.541 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la plupart des retraités

00:00:37.938 --> 00:00:41.775 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du milieu de l'aviation,

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:43.010 size:53% position:73% line:53%
s'affairent à restaurer

00:00:40.641 --> 00:00:44.211 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de vieux avions.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:45.446 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Comme Johmamamamanton,

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:46.647 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un ancien pilote d'Air Canada,

00:00:44.311 --> 00:00:47.881 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avec, a son actif, 22 000 heures

00:00:45.546 --> 00:00:49.083 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de vol.

00:00:46.747 --> 00:00:50.317 size:53% position:73% line:53%
JOHN DUCKMANTON,

00:00:47.982 --> 00:00:51.552 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pilorarararaité d'Air Canada

00:00:49.183 --> 00:00:52.786 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Je suis un pilote retraité

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:54.288 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'Air Canada, je prends

00:00:51.652 --> 00:00:55.522 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ma retraite depuis 17 ans.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:56.724 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Vous avez piloté quoi chez

00:00:54.388 --> 00:00:58.258 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Air Canada, quel avion?

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:59.793 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le dc-9, le boeing 767,

00:00:56.824 --> 00:01:01.295 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'airbus 310-20.

00:00:58.358 --> 00:01:02.830 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Autre appareil unique:

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:04.331 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un Blériota a a a volé

00:01:01.395 --> 00:01:06.366 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à Montréal en 1910.

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:08.368 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le premier avion qui a volé

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:10.404 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par dessus montréal pour

00:01:06.467 --> 00:01:19.146 size:53% position:73% line:53%
50 minutes.

00:01:08.469 --> 00:01:21.148 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Des avions, mais aussi

00:01:10.504 --> 00:01:22.683 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'anciens simulateurs de vol.

00:01:19.246 --> 00:01:23.917 size:53% position:73% line:53%
KEN FINCKEN, ingénieur retraité

00:01:21.248 --> 00:01:25.152 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de CAE de Montréal

00:01:22.783 --> 00:01:26.654 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ça, ça prend du temps.

00:01:24.018 --> 00:01:28.188 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Caiaiaiaiait en pièces toutes

00:01:25.252 --> 00:01:29.723 size:53% position:73% line:53%
détachées. C'est le fun, puis

00:01:26.754 --> 00:01:31.225 size:53% position:73% line:53%
comme c'est faite dans

00:01:28.288 --> 00:01:33.227 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les années 40, c'est très

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:35.262 size:53% position:73% line:53%
intéressant.

00:01:31.325 --> 00:01:37.264 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Un musée qui cherche un nouvel

00:01:33.327 --> 00:01:38.799 size:53% position:73% line:53%
emplacement et qui souhaite

00:01:35.362 --> 00:01:40.034 size:53% position:73% line:53%
devenir une référence pour

00:01:37.364 --> 00:01:41.235 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les passionnés de l'aviation.

00:01:38.899 --> 00:01:42.770 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On cherche de l'argent pour

00:01:40.134 --> 00:01:44.304 size:53% position:73% line:53%
monter des fonds, pour

00:01:41.335 --> 00:01:45.839 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une expansion.

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:47.341 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Un petit musée consacré

00:01:44.405 --> 00:01:48.876 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à la conservation de l'histoire

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:50.110 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aéronautique, avec une attention

00:01:47.441 --> 00:01:51.645 size:53% position:73% line:53%
particulière aux réalisations

00:01:48.976 --> 00:01:53.147 size:53% position:73% line:53%
québecoises. Tout ça, grace

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:54.682 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à des bénévoles dévoués.

00:01:51.745 --> 00:01:58.485 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici, Jacques Bissonnet,

00:01:53.247 --> 00:01:58.485 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Radio-Canada,

00:01:54.782 --> 00:01:58.485 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Sainte-Anne-de-Bellevue.

